#: ../data/xed.appdata.xml.in.h:1
msgid "A Text Editor"
msgstr "'n Teksredigeerder"

#: ../data/xed.appdata.xml.in.h:2
msgid ""
"<p> Xed is a small, but powerful text editor. It has most standard text "
"editor functions and fully supports international text in Unicode. Advanced "
"features include syntax highlighting and automatic indentation of source "
"code, printing and editing of multiple documents in one window. </p> <p> Xed "
"is extensible through a plugin system, which currently includes support for "
"spell checking, comparing files, viewing CVS ChangeLogs, and adjusting "
"indentation levels. </p>"
msgstr ""
"<p> Xed is 'n klein, maar kragtige teksredigeerder. Dit het die meeste "
"standaard teksredigeerder-funksies en ondersteun ten volle internasionale "
"teks in Unicode. Gevorderde kenmerke sluit sintaksverligting en outomatiese "
"inkeping van bronkode in, asook die druk en redigering van verskeie "
"dokumente in een venster. </p> <p> Xed is uitbreibaar deur 'n inpropsisteem, "
"wat tans ondersteuning insluit vir speltoetsing, die vergelyking van lêers, "
"die bekyk van CVS-ChangeLogs, en die aanpassing van inkepingsvlakke. </p>"

